<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>10 / 待深化研究</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>方向 8：低门槛接入、识别确认与断网恢复</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#E8A33D' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>部分实现</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={170} viewBox='0 0 1140 170'><rect x='0' y='40' width='123' height='88' rx='8' fill='#0E2340' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='61.5' y='84.0' font-size='20' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>拍照 / 批量图片 / PDF</text><line x1='129' y1='84' x2='155' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M155 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='169' y='40' width='123' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='230.5' y='84.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>检查清晰度、页序与重复</text><line x1='298' y1='84' x2='324' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M324 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='338' y='40' width='123' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='399.5' y='84.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>匹配试卷、题号及学生</text><line x1='467' y1='84' x2='493' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M493 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='507' y='40' width='123' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='568.5' y='84.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>展示原图与识别结果</text><line x1='636' y1='84' x2='662' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M662 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='676' y='40' width='123' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='737.5' y='84.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>确认或局部修正</text><line x1='805' y1='84' x2='831' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M831 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='845' y='40' width='123' height='88' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='906.5' y='84.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>批改</text><line x1='974' y1='84' x2='1000' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M1000 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='1014' y='40' width='123' height='88' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='1075.5' y='84.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>学情记录</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, flex: 1 }}><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>术语辨析</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>手写识别中 offline 指静态图像、online 指轨迹输入；网络断开是另一问题，照片导入与断网同步分别设计。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>不猜测</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>匹配失败进待分配区域，不猜测学生身份、不把未识别作答算成空白；没有时间信息时明确缺失，不从笔迹位置或文件保存时间推算原始作答用时。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>断网优先保证</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>已下载材料可读、作答草稿可保存、未提交内容可恢复；未运行的批改 / 出题不能显示为完成。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 270, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E3E8EF', borderRadius: 8, overflow: 'hidden', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 4, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #1E7BE0 0%, #00A9B5 100%)' }} /><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, padding: 20, flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>七种故障场景</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>上传中断、提交已接收但响应丢失、应用重启、重复点击、切换账号、只失败一页、旧版题目已被修改。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：待深化功能研究.md §5</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 102 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>